  <prompt>Owner 2026-11-26 (051 OQ-5): "only +New is required". The KPI assessment subgrid shows both "New KPI Assessment" (the SecureChild BFF create-then-open) and "Add KPI Assessment" (`sprk.matter.subgrid.kpi.AddKpiButton`). Remove "Add KPI Assessment" from the repo ribbon and from everything that requires it; keep "+ New".</prompt>
  <role>Spaarke Dataverse ribbon developer.</role>
  <goal>No repo ribbon defines `sprk.matter.subgrid.kpi.AddKpiButton`; the native-create config, `-Verify`, the ArchTests and the Pester tests no longer require it, and they now require that it is ABSENT from the KPI assessment ribbon; the subgrid "+ New" rule and every other 051 surface are unchanged.</goal>

  <context>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">src/dataverse/solutions/SpaarkeMaster/Entities/sprk_KPIAssessment/RibbonDiff.xml (CustomAction, CommandDefinition, its rules if used only by it, LocLabels)</file>
      <file role="modify">infrastructure/dataverse/ribbon/NativeCreateRibbons/native-create-surfaces.json (`alsoPresent` on sprk_kpiassessment; the "+ Add KPI" wording in the budget and KPI reasons)</file>
      <file role="modify">infrastructure/dataverse/ribbon/NativeCreateRibbons/Merge-NativeCreateRibbon.ps1, scripts/Test-NativeCreateSurfaces.ps1 and their Pester tests, if they hard-code Add KPI</file>
      <file role="modify">tests/Spaarke.ArchTests (the `AddMemo_AndAddKpi_...` test and its control: keep the Add Memo half)</file>
      <file role="read">src/solutions/SpaarkeCore/entities/sprk_matter/RibbonDiff/add-kpi-ribbon.xml, src/solutions/webresources/sprk_kpi_ribbon_actions.js, src/dataverse/solutions/SpaarkeMaster/WebResources/sprk_kpi_ribbon_actions.js: report whether anything else uses them; delete a file only if nothing does, and say which</file>
      <file role="do-not-touch">projects/**/notes, projects/**/CLAUDE.md, .claude/**</file>
    </relevant-files>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint>Repo only: no Dataverse write, no import, no publish.</constraint>
    <constraint>Add Memo on the event form is unchanged and still required by its checks.</constraint>
    <constraint>Re-running `Merge-NativeCreateRibbon.ps1` on all tables leaves every file other than the KPI ribbon byte-identical.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion>`grep -r AddKpiButton src/dataverse infrastructure tests scripts` finds nothing except a must-be-absent check.</criterion>
    <criterion>A must-fire control: the check fails when a ribbon still contains the Add KPI button; must-not-fire: it passes on the edited ribbon.</criterion>
    <criterion>Pester for the NativeCreateRibbons scripts green; Spaarke.ArchTests green (without --no-build).</criterion>
